eck; it is only one conjunct of the validation condition. The supplied source does not show a successful create path beyond this denial, and no decisive runtime fact is missing under the stated premises.","facts":[{"id":"entry-share-create","kind":"entry","statement":"ShareLinkViewSet is the create-capable viewset for ShareLink and declares its permission classes.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-31c7d9610aa471a1","startLine":4696,"endLine":4710}]},{"id":"binding-request-user-serializer","kind":"binding","statement":"PassUserMixin passes request.user into serializers that are SerializerWithPerms subclasses.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-31c7d9610aa471a1","startLine":411,"endLine":428}]},{"id":"control-sharelink-post-permission","kind":"control","statement":"PaperlessObjectPermissions maps POST to the model add permission, so the share-link object creation permission is add_sharelink.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-f24e5731eac21501","startLine":36,"endLine":43}]},{"id":"resource-target-document-validation","kind":"binding","statement":"Share-link serializer validation receives the referenced document and applies a dedicated validate_document check.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-d74dd1895d260a60","startLine":2873,"endLine":2881}]},{"id":"control-owner-aware-document-view","kind":"control","statement":"Target-document validation requires both global documents.view_document and the owner-aware has_perms_owner_aware view_document check.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-d74dd1895d260a60","startLine":2873,"endLine":2882}]},{"id":"condition-owner-aware-check","kind":"condition","statement":"The owner-aware single-object check allows the owner or an object permission recognized by ObjectPermissionChecker; for a document owned by another user without an object grant, that check is false under the premises.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-f24e5731eac21501","startLine":624,"endLine":635}]},{"id":"effect-sharelink-create-denied","kind":"effect","statement":"Failure of the target-document validation raises PermissionDenied, so the share-link object is not created.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-d74dd1895d260a60","startLine":2882,"endLine":2886}]}],"decisiveMissingFacts":[],"suggestedObservations":[]}]}}],"tokens":{"input":3493,"output":914,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0},"costUsd":null,"durationMs":31980.187199999928,"stopReason":"tool_use"},"schemaValidation":{"valid":true,"diagnostics":[]},"endedAt":"2026-09-29T07:59:31.806Z"}}
